      "seo": {
        "html_title": "Abstract Tilly Dress | Metallic Gold Fleck - Never Fully Dressed",
        "meta_description": "Designed in London, the Abstract Tilly Dress has gold brushstrokes, an elasticated waist and a pull-on fit for vacations, parties or summer weddings."
      },
      "description_html": "<p>An abstract multicoloured print layered with gold brushstrokes and metallic flecks that catch the light. Cut from lightweight pleated fabric, it features a draped, voluminous bodice paired with a fitted midaxi skirt. Style with sandals, a beaded bag and statement jewellery for vacations, parties or summer weddings.</p><p><strong>Garment can be worn off the shoulder or high on the shoulder. The elasticated waist allows you to adjust where the garment sits for a comfortable, personalized fit.</strong></p><p>- Elasticated waistband<br>- Pull on</p><p>Composition: 97% Polyester, 3% Elastane</p><p>Length: 131cm side neck point to hem</p><p><strong>Please Note - This length is based on our size 10 sample. Our products are graded, therefore smaller sizes will be shorter and larger sizes will be longer</strong></p><p>Base Colour: Multi</p><p>Wash Care: 30 Degree Wash</p><p>XS= 4/6, S= 6/8, M = 10/12, L= 14/16, XL= 18/20, XXL = 22/24, XXXL = 26/28</p><p>We’re more about the planet than we are perfection, so can’t guarantee the exact print placement shown here. This is down to how we cut the fabric to limit wastage.</p>",
