            "occurrence": 1,
            "text": "An abstract multicoloured print layered with gold brushstrokes and metallic flecks that catch the light. Cut from lightweight pleated fabric, it features a draped, voluminous bodice paired with a fitted midaxi skirt. Style with sandals, a beaded bag and statement jewellery for vacations, parties or summer weddings."
